@@@ note
As line-start-bullet-marker. The digits can't be escaped — a backslash only escapes ASCII
punctuation — so the delimiter is. See #6.

@@@ input
alpha bravo charlie delta 1. echo foxtrot golf.

@@@ wrap 80
alpha bravo charlie delta 1. echo foxtrot golf.

@@@ wrap 14
alpha bravo
charlie delta
1\. echo
foxtrot golf.

@@@ unwrap
alpha bravo charlie delta 1. echo foxtrot golf.
